{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"11f7002f-1250-416f-bd07-34f6030c1de7","agentId":"ae3590b7e2f938057","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 cache-aware / cache-oblivious 数据结构在 CP / SAT solver 内核（特别是 propagator、watch list、conflict analysis）的应用，2024-2026 进展。\n\n**背景：** i9-13900KS L1=80KB/core, L2=2MB/core, L3=36MB shared。CP-SAT 的 watch list 和 propagator queue 数据布局影响 cache miss 率。如果有现成 cache-aware 改造经验，可能在我们这种 long-running 求解上有数百分比影响。\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. CDCL solver 的 cache 性能 profile（最近论文）\n2. SoA vs AoS 在 watch list 的实证\n3. Bit-parallel data structures（roaring bitmap 等）\n4. Cache-conscious B-tree / hash for clause storage\n5. CP-SAT 内部数据布局（perron/team 公开材料）\n6. 跟编译器优化（Round 6 #aa2c march+LTO+PGO）的协同\n7. profile-guided 数据布局\n\n输出末尾：\"对 CP-SAT 用户层（不改 OR-Tools 源码）有什么可做\""},"uuid":"65405a0d-2730-4ed2-b709-8022fcaf69ff","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:25:21.761Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
